[00:09:25.360 --> 00:09:29.640]
Well, essentially it stands for week signal propagation reporter.

[00:09:30.060 --> 00:09:33.840]
It is a protocol that's used by the amateur radio community.

[00:09:34.580 --> 00:09:40.480]
Basically for week signal radio communication between different amateur radio operators.

[00:09:41.080 --> 00:09:47.380]
The idea is what if we want to send a transmission as far as possible.

[00:09:48.040 --> 00:09:49.840]
Let's just do some trade off.

