[00:09:55.320 --> 00:10:00.080]
So essentially we're sending a 50 bit worth of data over two minutes.

[00:10:00.100 --> 00:10:01.320]
So that's very slow.

[00:10:01.320 --> 00:10:03.200]
So right, you can't stream video over that.

[00:10:06.260 --> 00:10:10.340]
And let's see who else in the world can receive that message.

[00:10:10.800 --> 00:10:11.880]
So actually this is really cool.

[00:10:12.280 --> 00:10:19.220]
This picture here was created with this wisponnet.org and Philip the lecturer himself actually created

[00:10:19.220 --> 00:10:19.520]
